
# Simulink / CarMaker model and data artifacts must never be line-ending
# converted. core.autocrlf=true on this machine injected CRLF into
# TorqueVect.mdl on checkout, growing it by ~176 KB and producing
# "ReleaseInfo is invalid" / "invalid document structure" warnings when
# Simulink parsed it.
*.mdl   -text
*.dbc   -text
*.a2l   -text
*.slx   binary
*.sldd  binary
*.mlapp binary
*.mldatx binary
*.slxc  binary
*.rd5   binary
